        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-5008-12489"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5011-5032"><rb>自體</rb><rt>じたい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5032-5050">周三が、此の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5050-5062"><rb>繪</rb><rt>ゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5062-5065">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5065-5077"><rb>描</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5077-5095">き始めた時の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5095-5122"><rb>意氣込</rb><rt>いきごみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5122-5149">と謂ツたら、それは</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-5149-5203" corresp="#source-5164-5203"><seg source="#source-5149-5164">すばらしい</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5203-5224"><rb>勢</rb><rt>いきほひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5224-5239">で、何でも</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-5239-5281" corresp="#source-5248-5281"><seg source="#source-5239-5248">すツか</seg></hi><seg source="#source-5281-5284">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5284-5308"><rb>在來</rb><rt>ざいらい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5308-5320">の藝術を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5320-5344"><rb>放擲</rb><rt>うつちや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5344-5353">ツて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5353-5371"><rb>新</rb><rt>あたら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5371-5401">しい藝術に入るのだと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5401-5425"><rb>誇稱</rb><rt>こしよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5425-5434">して、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5434-5446"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5446-5449">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5449-5476"><rb>計畫</rb><rt>けいくわく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5476-5479">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5479-5500"><rb>抱負</rb><rt>ほうふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5500-5503">も</seg><rub